  triage:title "boundaries/atm-storage/task-store.toml forbidden_edges lacks the C5 entry atm-http-runtime -> atm-storage" ;
  triage:description "Code contract C5 specifies four forbidden_edges for the TaskStore boundary record; at 88c579a18 boundaries/atm-storage/task-store.toml carries three and omits \"atm-http-runtime -> atm-storage\", the one edge the sprint prose singles out as must-not-gain. No live violation exists (atm-http-runtime keeps atm-storage dev-dependency-only), but the mechanical gates (.just/lint_boundaries.py; crates/atm-architecture/tests/task_store_boundary.rs, which string-matches and does not read forbidden_edges) would not catch future drift on this edge. Found by arch-qa ARCH-002, ruthless-boundary-qa RBQA-F003 (blocking) and req-qa ATM-QA-007 (important) on PR #1191 QA-1; rolled up to blocking." ;
